703 0 obj
  << /ActualText (UX\057UI Designer and Product Designer with 2 years of hands\055on experience turning product needs and business goals into digital experiences that are intuitive\054 functional and visually consistent\054 plus 8\053 years of systemic reasoning as an architect applied to building user\055centered solutions\056 I\047m fluent in Figma \024 Auto Layout\054 Variables\054 Prototyping and Design System organization \024 to run the full design process\054 from concept exploration to wireframes\054 user flows\054 mockups and high\055fidelity interactive prototypes\056 I have a solid grasp of usability\054 accessibility and responsive design principles\054 and the ability to turn complex requirements into clear\054 intuitive\054 well\055structured interfaces\056 I pair creative and conceptual thinking with a strong command of layout\054 typography\054 visual hierarchy and interface consistency\056 I collaborate naturally with product\054 engineering and other stakeholders\054 with good organization\054 attention to detail and a genuine drive to keep learning and improving\056)
