713 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Landing Page \046 Conversion\nChallenge\072 restructure the digital presence to increase trust and direct sales\056\nProcess\072 I conducted recorded user interviews and surveys\054 plus journey mapping\054 to identify friction points\073 I built wireframes and interactive prototypes in Figma for validation before development\056\nSolution\072 a full redesign of the landing page focused on information architecture and social proof\056\nResult\072 a 15\045 increase in sales and direct conversions via WhatsApp\054 reducing pre\055sale communication noise\056\n\nInternal Management Platform \050SaaS\051\nChallenge\072 4h\057day of operational waste from manual order and invoicing processes\056\nSolution\072 owned Discovery\054 User Flow and Wireframing\056\nResult\072 automation of the business\047s logistics and administrative workflow\056)
     /K [ 12 ]
